@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowThickness 3

title MiRACLE Data Pipeline – Simple View

' Colors
' Data sources:  ***REMOVED***D9EDF7
' Processing:    ***REMOVED***FCF8E3
' Models:        ***REMOVED***E6E6FA
' Outputs:       ***REMOVED***DFF0D8

rectangle "Historical PV\n+ Weather" as HIST ***REMOVED***D9EDF7
rectangle "Weather\nForecast API" as WAPI ***REMOVED***D9EDF7

rectangle "Preprocessor A\n(historic)" as PA ***REMOVED***FCF8E3
rectangle "Preprocessor B\n(real time)" as PB ***REMOVED***FCF8E3

rectangle "LSTM Encoder\n(learn past patterns)" as LSTM ***REMOVED***E6E6FA
rectangle "PVLib Physics\n(irradiance, POA, temp)" as PVLIB ***REMOVED***E6E6FA

rectangle "Feature Store\n(combined inputs)" as FS ***REMOVED***FCF8E3

rectangle "Temporal Fusion\nTransformer\n(final forecaster)" as TFT ***REMOVED***E6E6FA

rectangle "PV Power Forecasts" as OUT ***REMOVED***DFF0D8
rectangle "RL Meta Controller\n(adaptive decisions)" as RL ***REMOVED***E6E6FA

' Main horizontal flow
HIST --> PA
PA   --> LSTM
LSTM --> FS
FS   --> TFT
TFT  --> OUT

PB   --> FS

HIST --> PVLIB
PVLIB --> FS

' RL interactions (no labels on arrows, use note instead)
OUT  --> RL
WAPI --> RL
RL   --> PB
RL   --> TFT

note left of RL
  Monitors forecast errors and API quality.
  Decides when to:
   • adjust API use / cadence
   • fine tune models
   • trigger reforecast
end note

@enduml
